#. Description of the plugin
#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Vendor-only Holiday Mode toggle that hides (drafts) and restores all of a vendor's listings, with an on-site banner while active. Restoring listings requires an active WooCommerce Subscription (admins bypass; sites without WooCommerce Subscriptions are not gated)."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
